steps.human:
The product-truth store (flows, mock data, mockups) lives under docs/product-truth, right next to the acceptance-criteria store it links into.

I/O boundary: The store consists of separately schema-checked JSON artifacts, joined by index.json. There is no single combined store DTO; examples show distinct artifact projections.

Contract fields and examples (generated)
Consumes:
  flow/id: string (required)
  flow/component: string (required)
  flow/steps: array (required)
  flow/readiness: string (required)
  Schema: [flow](docs/product-truth/schemas/flow.schema.json)
  mock_data/id: string (required)
  mock_data/entities: object (required)
  Schema: [mock_data](docs/product-truth/schemas/mock-data.schema.json)
  mockup/id: string (required)
  mockup/screen: string (required)
  mockup/renders: null|string (required)
  Schema: [mockup](docs/product-truth/schemas/mockup.schema.json)
Produces:
  SOURCE-REVIEWED DOCUMENTATION: Projection of generate_product_truth.py write_index/build_by_ac/build_by_flow. Documents index.json lookups, not a complete runtime validator or automatic source parity.
  index/artifacts: array (optional)
  index/by_component: object (optional)
  index/by_entity: object (optional)
  index/by_flow: object (optional)
  index/by_ac: object (optional)
  Schema: [index](docs/product-truth/schemas/product-truth-index-projection.schema.json)

Input illustrative flow projection; not an execution receipt — flow; illustrative; selected fields only; full required/defaulted fields in linked contract:
{
  "id": "leafcutter/define-a-feature",
  "component": "ux-prototyping",
  "readiness": "draft",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "approve",
      "order": 1,
      "label": "Approve the feature",
      "human": "Review the proposed behavior.",
      "implements": [
        "UXP-531"
      ],
      "impl_status": "not_started",
      "screen": "feature-review"
    }
  ]
}

Input illustrative mock_data projection; not an execution receipt — mock_data; illustrative; selected fields only; full required/defaulted fields in linked contract:
{
  "id": "leafcutter/feature-review",
  "entities": {
    "Ac": {
      "fields": {
        "id": "string; stable acceptance criterion identifier"
      },
      "records": [
        {
          "id": "ACD-300"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}

Input illustrative mockup projection; not an execution receipt — mockup; illustrative; selected fields only; full required/defaulted fields in linked contract:
{
  "id": "leafcutter/feature-review",
  "screen": "feature-review",
  "renders": null
}

